1
00:00:04,87 --> 00:00:06,06
Hey,new wallet?
新皮夾？

2
00:00:06,20 --> 00:00:07,36
It was time.
也該換了

3
00:00:07,57 --> 00:00:11,80
The old condom ring in the leather just doesn't say "cool" anymore.
保險套圖案的皮夾已經不酷了

4
00:00:12,04 --> 00:00:15,67
Rachel,you just put an empty carton back in the fridge.
瑞秋，你把空紙盒放進冰箱裡

5
00:00:15,91 --> 00:00:18,64
I know, but the garbage was full.
我知道，但是垃圾袋滿了

6
00:00:19,41 --> 00:00:21,88
Have you ever taken out the trash?
你有倒過垃圾嗎？ 

7
00:00:23,69 --> 00:00:25,98
Since you've lived here?
從你搬來之後？

8
00:00:26,12 --> 00:00:29,61
Well,I thought you liked doing it.
我以為你喜歡倒

9
00:00:34,03 --> 00:00:36,22
-Third door on the left. -Right!
左邊第三個門 好

10
00:00:38,40 --> 00:00:40,06
（垃圾槽）

11
00:00:46,37 --> 00:00:47,93
Hey,Mr. Treeger.
崔格先生

12
00:01:07,10 --> 00:01:08,22
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

13
00:01:13,50 --> 00:01:14,49
I'm sorry.
對不起

14
00:01:14,74 --> 00:01:16,50
It's a little old but....
放了一段時間，不過…

15
00:01:18,24 --> 00:01:21,33
You're clogging up the chute I just unclogged.
不是 我才剛通好又被你塞住了

16
00:01:21,61 --> 00:01:25,48
I'm sorry. I don't come in here a lot.
對不起，我不常來

17
00:01:25,75 --> 00:01:28,51
Of course not. You're a little princess.
當然啦，你是小公主嘛

18
00:01:30,15 --> 00:01:31,48
Daddy,buy me a pizza.
爸爸，幫我買披薩

19
00:01:31,69 --> 00:01:33,42
Daddy,buy me a candy factory.
爸爸，幫我買糖果工廠

20
00:01:33,62 --> 00:01:37,52
Daddy,make the cast of Cats sing "Happy Birthday" to me.
爸爸，叫「貓」的演員 幫我唱「生日快樂歌」

21
00:01:38,66 --> 00:01:40,49
You think you can come here...
你以為你可以來這裡

22
00:01:40,76 --> 00:01:44,60
...make a mess and a big man in coveralls will clean it up?
搞得一團亂，反正有人會收？

23
00:01:44,80 --> 00:01:47,86
Think of someone else for a change.
去找別人吧

24
00:01:52,04 --> 00:01:53,70
Okay,I'm sorry.
對不起嘛

25
00:02:00,22 --> 00:02:03,28
God,if you're going to cry about it!
天哪，這樣也要哭

26
00:02:05,12 --> 00:02:07,02
The One With Ballroom Dancing
本集播出：「與郎共舞」

00:02:10,12 --> 00:02:12,02
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

27
00:02:52,80 --> 00:02:54,89
Treeger made you cry?
崔格把你氣哭了？ 

28
00:02:55,60 --> 00:02:59,90
He said really mean things that were only partly true.
他說了一些很惡劣 又不盡真實的話

29
00:03:01,11 --> 00:03:02,94
I'll teach him a lesson.
我去教訓他

30
00:03:03,14 --> 00:03:05,64
Joey,don't. Let's forget about it.
喬伊，不要，我看還是算了

31
00:03:05,88 --> 00:03:09,78
That's easy for you to say. You weren't almost just killed!
你說得倒容易 差點被殺的又不是你

32
00:03:09,98 --> 00:03:13,28
All right,that's it. School is in session!
夠了，家裡又不是沒大人

33
00:03:16,79 --> 00:03:18,05
Is this a gym card?
天哪，這是健身中心卡嗎？

34
00:03:18,26 --> 00:03:20,49
Oh,yeah,gym member.
沒錯，我是會員

35
00:03:20,90 --> 00:03:24,26
I try to go four times a week, but I've missed...
我盡量1周去四次，但已經…

36
00:03:24,50 --> 00:03:25,93
...the last 1200 times.
一千兩百次沒去了

37
00:03:27,84 --> 00:03:29,46
So why don't you quit?
那你怎麼不退出？

38
00:03:30,34 --> 00:03:32,24
You don't think I've tried?
你以為我沒試過？

39
00:03:34,64 --> 00:03:38,51
You think I like having $50 a month taken from my account?
你以為我喜歡每個月 戶頭被扣50元？

40
00:03:38,85 --> 00:03:41,91
They make you go all the way down there.
他們逼你大老遠跑過去

41
00:03:42,35 --> 00:03:46,58
They use all these phrases and peppiness to confuse you.
用各種課程和效果讓你昏頭

42
00:03:46,85 --> 00:03:48,95
And then they bring out Maria.
然後還叫瑪麗亞出來

43
00:03:49,99 --> 00:03:52,62
-Who is Maria? -Oh,Maria!
誰是瑪麗亞？ 瑪麗亞

45
00:03:54,26 --> 00:03:55,79
You can't say no to her.
她令人無法抗拒

46
00:03:56,00 --> 00:03:59,80
She's like this lycra, spandex-covered,gym treat.
她是穿緊身衣的會員獨享優惠

47
00:04:01,97 --> 00:04:05,77
Do you need me to go with you and hold your hand?
要我陪你去握著你的手嗎？

48
00:04:06,01 --> 00:04:07,77
You're strong enough to face her?
你可以單獨應付她？

49
00:04:07,98 --> 00:04:09,97
Oh,no. You'll have to come.
不是，你得陪我去

50
00:04:15,35 --> 00:04:17,68
Tribbiani. Hold on.
崔比亞尼 等一下

51
00:04:17,95 --> 00:04:19,04
I'll get the plunger.
馬桶又不通了？

52
00:04:22,39 --> 00:04:25,19
You hold on. You made my friend Rachel cry.
你才等一下 你把我朋友瑞秋氣哭了

53
00:04:25,46 --> 00:04:27,55
So you'll go and apologize to her...
馬上去向她道歉 

54
00:04:27,80 --> 00:04:29,73
...unless you want me to call the landlord.
否則我就通知房東

55
00:04:30,00 --> 00:04:31,16
And tell him what?
你要說什麼？

56
00:04:31,37 --> 00:04:33,89
Maybe you haven't heard of "not making girls cry."
你沒聽過 男人不該讓女人流淚嗎？

57
00:04:34,17 --> 00:04:38,63
Maybe you haven't heard of the Rent Stabilization Act of 1968.
你沒聽過 1968年租屋安定法案嗎？

58
00:04:39,04 --> 00:04:41,63
I have actually not heard of that.
我還真的沒聽過

59
00:04:44,15 --> 00:04:46,01
Your friends are violating it.
你朋友違反這個法案

60
00:04:46,31 --> 00:04:49,75
I've been nice until now, but I don't need this grief.
我一直很客氣 但我不必受這種罪

61
00:04:49,98 --> 00:04:51,54
I'm telling the landlord...
我要告訴房東

62
00:04:51,75 --> 00:04:55,02
...Monica's illegally subletting her grandmother's place.
摩妮卡非法分租她奶奶的房子

63
00:04:55,22 --> 00:04:57,56
Your friends are out of here,pal.
你朋友得搬出去了

64
00:04:59,03 --> 00:05:01,93
Why don't you tell me something I don't know?
別說一些我不懂的事

65
00:05:05,67 --> 00:05:08,33
Somebody tell me I don't have to work today.
誰能讓我今天不用上班

66
00:05:08,60 --> 00:05:09,76
What's the matter?
怎麼了？

67
00:05:10,04 --> 00:05:13,17
My first massage is this incredibly gorgeous guy.
今天第一個客人是個大帥哥

68
00:05:13,41 --> 00:05:15,10
Every time I see him, I want to...
每次見到他，我就想…

69
00:05:15,38 --> 00:05:17,71
...do things to him I can't charge for.
替他免費服務一下

70
00:05:21,22 --> 00:05:22,84
So do them for free.
那你就做啊

71
00:05:23,95 --> 00:05:26,08
No,it is forbidden.
不行，公司不准

72
00:05:27,36 --> 00:05:31,79
Mrs. Potter fires people for messing around with clients.
跟客人亂來會被波特太太開除

73
00:05:32,06 --> 00:05:34,53
And it's against my oath as a masseuse.
而且也違反我的按摩師誓言

74
00:05:35,26 --> 00:05:38,43
-They make you take an oath? -No,I made myself take one.
你還得發誓？ 是我自己要發的

76
00:05:38,63 --> 00:05:40,86
No fooling around with clients...
不得與客人亂來…

77
00:05:41,07 --> 00:05:43,44
...and always be prepared.
和有備無患

78
00:05:46,37 --> 00:05:50,28
That one's from the Boy Scouts, but it just makes good sense.
後面是童軍守則，不過說得通

79
00:05:52,05 --> 00:05:54,01
Why not give him to someone else?
你怎麼不把他轉給別人？

80
00:05:54,22 --> 00:05:56,95
No,I can handle it. I'm a professional.
不，我可以應付，我很專業

81
00:05:58,05 --> 00:06:00,65
Pheebs,is that a new ankle bracelet?
菲比，那是新腳鏈嗎？

82
00:06:01,16 --> 00:06:02,55
You got a pedicure.
你去修過腳趾甲 

83
00:06:02,79 --> 00:06:04,28
Your feet are all dressed up.
你的腳打扮過

84
00:06:06,09 --> 00:06:09,83
That's the only part he can see when he's on the table!
因為他在按摩台上 只看得到你的腳

85
00:06:12,10 --> 00:06:14,16
You're going to do some feet flirting!
你要用腳勾引他

86
00:06:14,74 --> 00:06:17,67
I don't know what you're talking about.
我不知道你們在說什麼

87
00:06:18,81 --> 00:06:21,10
How do you explain the toe ring?
那你幹嘛戴腳趾環？

88
00:06:23,58 --> 00:06:27,48
It's Arabian Princess Day at work. Leave me alone!
今天是阿拉伯公主日，行嗎？ 少囉唆啦

89
00:06:33,15 --> 00:06:34,75
My hero! What happened?
我的英雄！結果怎樣？

90
00:06:35,86 --> 00:06:38,92
I told him no one treats my friends like that.
我說誰也不准欺負我的姐妹

91
00:06:39,16 --> 00:06:41,15
And he better apologize. See you!
他最好上來道歉，先這樣

92
00:06:41,43 --> 00:06:42,92
Wait a minute.
等一下

93
00:06:43,60 --> 00:06:44,59
What did he say?
他怎麼說？

94
00:06:46,00 --> 00:06:49,66
He wouldn't apologize because you're living here illegally.
他說他不要 因為你們兩個違法

95
00:06:49,87 --> 00:06:52,67
Instead,he'll evict you. See you later!
他要趕你們走，再聯絡

96
00:06:52,87 --> 00:06:56,14
-You got us evicted? -I told you not to go down there.
你害我們要被趕走？ 我就叫你不要去找他

97
00:06:56,41 --> 00:06:57,61
He made Rachel cry!
他把瑞秋氣哭了

98
00:06:57,85 --> 00:06:59,54
Rachel always cries!
瑞秋本來就愛哭

99
00:07:00,82 --> 00:07:02,84
That's not true!
你亂講

100
00:07:04,65 --> 00:07:07,52
You go down there, and you suck up to him.
你給我下去拍他的馬屁

101
00:07:07,82 --> 00:07:10,55
You suck like you've never sucked before!
抱大腿學狗叫都行

102
00:07:11,86 --> 00:07:13,88
All right,I'll try.
好啦，我盡量

103
00:07:14,16 --> 00:07:17,15
If I can't,you stay with us till you get settled.
要是沒成功 你們就先來跟我們住

104
00:07:17,37 --> 00:07:19,53
-Go! -All right,all right.
去啦！ 好啦好啦

105
00:07:19,80 --> 00:07:22,40
I'll have to check first, but he'll be cool.
我得先問錢德，不過應該可以

106
00:07:27,51 --> 00:07:31,74
Remember what we talked about. You got to be strong.
記住剛才所說的，要堅定 

108
00:07:34,08 --> 00:07:35,38
Now one more time.
再來一次

109
00:07:35,65 --> 00:07:39,11
Don't you want a washboard stomach and rock-hard pecs?
你不想擁有平坦的小腹 和結實的胸肌嗎？

110
00:07:39,29 --> 00:07:42,92
No,I want a flabby gut and saggy man-breasts.
不想，我喜歡啤酒肚和大咪咪

111
00:07:43,96 --> 00:07:45,29
That's good.
很好

112
00:07:51,83 --> 00:07:53,30
I want to quit the gym.
我要退出會員

113
00:07:53,94 --> 00:07:55,40
You want to quit?
你要退出？

114
00:07:59,17 --> 00:08:00,83
I want to quit the gym.
我要退出會員

115
00:08:01,44 --> 00:08:05,67
You do realize you won't have access to our new Swedish spa?
那就不能享用 全新的瑞典SPA喔

116
00:08:11,65 --> 00:08:13,75
I want to quit the gym.
我要退出會員

117
00:08:14,46 --> 00:08:17,91
Dave in the membership office handles quitters.
好，請找會員服務部的戴維

118
00:08:20,29 --> 00:08:22,63
Excuse me. Are you a member?
抱歉，你是會員嗎？

119
00:08:23,26 --> 00:08:24,36
Me?
我？不是

120
00:08:26,33 --> 00:08:27,77
Sorry. Members only.
抱歉，會員才能進去

121
00:08:30,74 --> 00:08:32,50
I want to quit the gym!
我要退出會員

122
00:08:32,71 --> 00:08:35,27
It's okay,man. Be strong.
放心好了，要堅定

123
00:08:41,95 --> 00:08:44,11
Are you a member of any gym?
你有加入任何健身中心嗎？

124
00:08:44,35 --> 00:08:48,05
No,and I'm not going to be. So save your little speech.
我沒有，也不會 別白費唇舌了

125
00:08:48,26 --> 00:08:49,78
Okay,no problem.
好，沒問題

126
00:08:50,06 --> 00:08:51,39
Could you come here?
你來一下

127
00:08:54,46 --> 00:08:55,90
Hi,I'm Maria.
你好，我是瑪麗亞

128
00:09:00,74 --> 00:09:03,10
（舒活之家）

129
00:09:11,15 --> 00:09:13,11
You have really pretty feet.
你的腳很漂亮

130
00:09:14,78 --> 00:09:16,27
These old things?
這些雞爪？

131
00:09:17,92 --> 00:09:21,79
Would you spend time on my sciatic area? It's killing me.
幫我捏一下臀部，快痛死了

132
00:09:23,82 --> 00:09:25,05
You mean....
你是說…

133
00:09:25,26 --> 00:09:27,78
By sciatic,you mean...
你說的臀部是指…

134
00:09:28,00 --> 00:09:30,33
...the towel-covered portion?
毛巾蓋住的部分？ 

135
00:09:31,97 --> 00:09:33,83
Sure,I can do that.
好，沒問題，因為…

136
00:09:34,07 --> 00:09:37,66
Because the muscles in the sciatic area can get...
臀部的肌肉有時的確會…

137
00:09:37,94 --> 00:09:40,31
...real nice and tight.
緊實有彈性

138
00:09:44,78 --> 00:09:49,01
So tell me,Rick, how did you injure the area?
瑞克，你這裡怎麼會不舒服？

139
00:09:49,25 --> 00:09:52,12
A 16-hour sit-in for Greenpeace.
我為綠色和平組織 靜坐抗議16小時

140
00:10:03,66 --> 00:10:05,86
-Did you just bite me? -No!
你剛才咬我？ 沒有

141
00:10:15,54 --> 00:10:18,98
Please don't kick the girls out. This was my fault.
怎樣？ 別把她們趕走， 是我不好

143
00:10:19,18 --> 00:10:21,88
You want me to kick you guys out instead?
你要我把你們趕走嗎？

144
00:10:22,22 --> 00:10:25,52
You can't. Where would the chick and the duck live?
不行，那小雞小鴨要住哪裡？

145
00:10:26,02 --> 00:10:28,01
You have pets?
你們養寵物？

146
00:10:29,52 --> 00:10:31,12
Those are nicknames.
那是綽號

147
00:10:31,39 --> 00:10:33,86
I'm the "chick," and Chandler's the "duck."
我是小雞，錢德是小鴨

148
00:10:35,53 --> 00:10:38,36
I would've thought it was the other way around.
我會以為是反過來

149
00:10:39,53 --> 00:10:41,73
Come on. Let the girls stay.
拜託啦，讓她們留下來

150
00:10:42,00 --> 00:10:43,66
I'll do whatever you want.
你要我做什麼都行

151
00:10:43,97 --> 00:10:45,73
Really? You'd do anything?
真的？什麼都行？

152
00:10:46,04 --> 00:10:47,23
Yeah,absolutely.
對，沒錯

153
00:10:48,08 --> 00:10:49,41
I got something.
我知道你能做什麼了

154
00:10:49,64 --> 00:10:51,70
What is it?
什麼？

155
00:10:53,31 --> 00:10:55,54
Can you be my dancing partner?
你能當我的舞伴嗎？

156
00:10:58,39 --> 00:11:00,38
That's not prison lingo,is it?
這不是牢裡的黑話吧？

157
00:11:02,86 --> 00:11:06,05
I want to quit the gym.
我要退出會員

158
00:11:06,43 --> 00:11:09,66
Can you honestly tell me that you're 100% satisfied with your body.
你真的不必來這裡增強活力？

159
00:11:09,80 --> 00:11:11,79
Yes,yes. Most of the time.
大部分時候都不用

160
00:11:11,93 --> 00:11:16,53
I mean,sure,I have my bad days,but then I remember what a cute smile I have.
有時心情不好 我會想到我笑起來很可愛

161
00:11:17,04 --> 00:11:20,37
We were voted "Best-equipped Gym in New York" two years running.
我們連續2年被票選為 紐約設備最佳健身中心

162
00:11:20,51 --> 00:11:23,53
-Do you really want to give that up? -Yes,I hate it here.
你真的想放棄？ 對，我討厭這裡

163
00:11:23,68 --> 00:11:27,21
Everything that you have in here is very heavy.
這裡的東西都好重

164
00:11:32,02 --> 00:11:35,48
Really? Okay?
真的？好

165
00:11:35,79 --> 00:11:38,19
You want to make your friend work out alone?
你總不想讓你朋友落單吧？

166
00:11:38,63 --> 00:11:42,56
-What friend? -Your friend Ross. Just joined.
什麼朋友？ 你的朋友羅斯剛加入會員

167
00:11:51,31 --> 00:11:52,90
（中央咖啡館）

168
00:11:53,17 --> 00:11:54,73
His dancing partner?
他的舞伴？

169
00:11:54,94 --> 00:11:58,38
There's this superintendents' dance, "The Super Ball."
對，他們有一個管理員舞會 叫「管舞會」

170
00:12:00,75 --> 00:12:04,51
He wants to impress Marge, this lady super he likes.
他想引起一個女管理員 瑪姬的注意

171
00:12:04,75 --> 00:12:06,74
Why not practice with a girl?
那怎麼不找女生練？

172
00:12:06,95 --> 00:12:08,01
He's too shy.
他不好意思

173
00:12:08,22 --> 00:12:11,21
He's not good enough to dance with girls yet.
他覺得他還沒資格跟女生跳

174
00:12:11,43 --> 00:12:12,41
Yeah,right.
是啊

175
00:12:12,59 --> 00:12:16,96
He almost danced me right down that garbage chute.
他差點害我跳進那個垃圾槽裡

176
